{"4953120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "S21", "steam_appid": 4953120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4969190], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dear passengers, welcome to the temporary pedestrian underpass.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completion of the station has been delayed <span class=\"bb_strike\">by a few minutes. By a few years. By a few decades</span> indefinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please mind the gap between promise and reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >S21</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is an absurdist satire with a touch of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere ahead of you lies the station. It never gets finished. And it will not let you leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone in the tunnel. Almost alone. The voice on the loudspeakers keeps you company:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This temporary pedestrian underpass is equipped with</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A station (at the end, allegedly) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracks (in planning) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighting (in places) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clocks (several, all disagreeing) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exit (planning and building jurisdiction unclear) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice (impeccably formal, increasingly personal) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2–3 hour dwell time (might feel longer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any resemblance to real construction projects, living or delayed, is purely coincidental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your patience. Sincerely. But it's not like you have a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dear passengers, welcome to the temporary pedestrian underpass.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completion of the station has been delayed <span class=\"bb_strike\">by a few minutes. By a few years. By a few decades</span> indefinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please mind the gap between promise and reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >S21</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is an absurdist satire with a touch of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere ahead of you lies the station. It never gets finished. And it will not let you leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone in the tunnel. Almost alone. The voice on the loudspeakers keeps you company:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This temporary pedestrian underpass is equipped with</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A station (at the end, allegedly) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracks (in planning) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighting (in places) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clocks (several, all disagreeing) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exit (planning and building jurisdiction unclear) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice (impeccably formal, increasingly personal) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2–3 hour dwell time (might feel longer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any resemblance to real construction projects, living or delayed, is purely coincidental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your patience. Sincerely. But it's not like you have a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Dear passengers: Your train departs from Platform 9 in 20 minutes. Sounds doable. Or does it? An absurd game about the station that will never be finished and won’t let you leave. This game is under construction. Thank you for your understanding.", "supported_languages": "German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://sha